Feature: Jammers
  In the [[v4 rules]], a drone with a [[jammer]] can switch it on. Then the enemy drones within
  100 m of it are out of contact, as in a [[radio shadow]] that moves with it. A drone that flies
  a plan it was given before, or its queue, does not need the radio; a drone that waits for orders
  does.

  A jammer that is on is the loudest radio on the field. A fort or the spire that the enemy holds
  finds it from 800 m, and one tower is enough: the enemy sees it, and its hunters can fly at it.
  A jammer that is on also uses the battery one and a half times as fast.

  Expectation: A jammer that is on cuts the radio of the enemy drones near it
    Overrides: A depot does not block the radio more than 120 m away
    Overrides: A drone above the trees is in contact with no friend near

    Given the jammers are on
    And the payload of the Red scout is a jammer
    And the emission of the Red scout is jamming
    And the Red home tower is neutral
    And the first Blue drone is near the Red home tower
    And the Red scout is 50 m from the first Blue drone
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is cut

  Expectation: A jammer that is off cuts nothing
    Given the jammers are on
    And the payload of the Red scout is a jammer
    And the emission of the Red scout is loud
    And the Red home tower is neutral
    And the first Blue drone is near the Red home tower
    And the Red scout is 50 m from the first Blue drone
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is in contact

  Expectation: One tower finds a jammer that is on
    Given the jammers are on
    And the direction finding is on
    And the centre tower is neutral
    And the payload of the Red scout is a jammer
    And the emission of the Red scout is jamming
    And the Red scout is high between the Blue home tower and the centre tower
    Then the Red scout on the Blue map is seen

  Expectation: A jammer that is on uses the battery one and a half times as fast
    Given the jammers are on
    And the payload of the first Blue drone is a jammer
    And the emission of the first Blue drone is jamming
    And the battery of the first Blue drone is 100 s
    And the first Blue drone is 130 m from the west tower
    When the first Blue drone jams for 10 seconds
    Then the battery of the first Blue drone is 85 s
